# Live Instant for Instant Recipes — THIS is the source of truth.
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored), fill INSTANT_APP_ID, then:
#   ./sync-env.sh
#   # or just build: the Xcode pre-build script runs sync-env.sh for you
#
# Provision a persistent app + write this file with:
#   ./provision-live-app.sh
#
# Only INSTANT_APP_ID is required at runtime (also embedded as InstantAppID).
# INSTANT_ADMIN_TOKEN is for schema/perms push only — never ship it in the app.

INSTANT_APP_ID=
# INSTANT_ADMIN_TOKEN=
